<title>EGYPT: Egypt overall index rises to ninth straight high.</title>
<headline>Egypt overall index rises to ninth straight high.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's all-share index closed at yet another record high on Wednesday, rising 0.6 percent from Tuesday's close to 369.89 points, the Capital Market Authority said.</p>
<p>Wednesday's close is the ninth straigh high for the index in as many days.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 12 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
